=== ch7_intro ===
The autumn wind picks up along the ridge, and Wisp sits on its small hill, looking past it.
-> END

=== ch7_gust ===
A gust goes through the meadow, and everyone ends up a little somewhere else.
-> END

=== ch7_gone ===
Wisp went over the ridge and did not come back, and its hill is only a hill again.
-> END

=== ch7_close_call ===
The wind blew hard, but Wisp is still on its hill, looking at the ridge.
-> END
